{
    "index_patterns": ["ss4o_traces-gateway*"],
    "data_stream": { "timestamp_field": { "name": "startTime" } },
    "priority": 1000,
    "_meta": {
      "description": "SS4O traces for Secure MCP Gateway. dynamic:false. Service-map data goes to otel-v1-apm-service-map-*. ALL gateway-emitted span attributes use snake_case (underscores) -- the canonical `SpanAttributes` constants in `src/secure_mcp_gateway/plugins/telemetry/conventions.py` MUST be set as `enkrypt_auth_base_url` (not `enkrypt.auth.base_url`), `enkrypt_cache_hit` (not `enkrypt.cache.hit`), etc., so Data Prepper writes them as flat keyword fields instead of nested objects with `@` separators. The `@` only remains in: (a) OTel auto-emitted resource attrs that we don't control (`resource.attributes.service@name`, `resource.attributes.host@name`); (b) the special OS metadata field `@timestamp`. Field groups: OTel core (span ids, parent/state, traceGroup, status, events, links); resource attrs; identity tuple (snake_case); diagnostic snake_case ops; enkrypt_* operational namespace (all underscored); new snake_case validation/cache/playground ops; per-call detector signal (with `direction` keyword discriminating input vs output); policy & gateway-config metadata; sandbox subsystem; guardrail naming (guardrail_name / input_guardrail_name / output_guardrail_name / server_tools_guardrail_name / server_info_guardrail_name — all aligned with cloud config `*_guardrails_config.guardrail_name` field, not `policy_name`); request_type/mcp_method/source_event; correlation_id/request_id/custom_id/session_id/error_code (canonical short snake_case forms — these replaced the previous dotted `enkrypt.{correlation,custom,request,error,source}.{id,message,event,code}` fields and the `enkrypt_*` underscored equivalents have been dropped in favor of these short forms); input/output sizing + 3-phase latency split (preprocess/execution/postprocess); per-operation latency cluster (total_request/tool_call/forward/discovery/list_servers/server_info/auth/guardrail/input_guardrail/output_guardrail/relevancy/adherence/hallucination/pii_redact/pii_restore/cache_lookup/cache_write/cloud_api/cloud_auth_fetch/oauth/oauth_token_acquire/oauth_token_refresh/registry_lookup/consumer_info_lookup/mcp_initialize/mcp_handshake/config_reload/queue_wait — all `*_duration_ms` doubles, complement to span-native durationInNanos for rolling up child durations onto parent spans); guardrail registration metadata; session pool; OAuth; timeout escalation; hot reload; async guardrails; MCP protocol; tool annotations; admin/audit; convention dead-letters (enkrypt_guardrail_action/blocked/checkpoint/violation_types) pre-declared for future wiring."
    },
    "template": {
      "settings": {
        "number_of_shards": 1,
        "number_of_replicas": 0,
